# KerryOS egress allowlist -- DENY BY DEFAULT (FilterDefaultDeny Yes).
# One regex per line, matched against the request DOMAIN (FilterURLs Off).
# Both the bare domain and the wildcard form are listed so apex + subdomains
# are covered regardless of anchoring semantics. Everything not matching is
# denied with HTTP 403.
#
# To add a domain: append both forms with a one-line comment saying what it
# is for, then `docker compose restart <proxy-service>`.
# See spec section 4.4 for the dependency-mapping procedure before adding
# anything SokoResult pulls in (auth, fonts, image hosts).

sokoresult\.com
.*\.sokoresult\.com
github\.com
.*\.github\.com

